    "section": "17. Monsters And Vehicles",
    "ruleNumber": "17.02",
    "order": 208,
    "anchor": "17.02",
    "summary": "Models without bases, and certain other large models, have **FRAME**. It changes [Measuring Distances](vsdata:core-rule/measuring-distances) and turning:\n\n- Measure to or from a **FRAME** model's nearest point, even if it has a base, unless the rule says otherwise.\n- During a move, a **FRAME** model without a base may rotate freely about its central axis while staying upright.",
